      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also, you CAN cause this to happen in desktop mode if you enter a station from another station while your head is tilted in any direction other than looking directly forwards. The workaround is to have a script that will make the player exit the station and then instantly enter the new one a frame after.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "656a0e274dec4963d85eab71",
      "aiGenerated": false,
      "author": {
        "_id": "5f3287055bc2dc276e0f1630",
        "alias": "Lemon Silverfish",
        "aliasID": "65c289dced6eefce4cc219ab",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/38c081222540fbe548c41493c9650ae2.png",
        "created": "2020-08-11T11:54:45.784Z",
